\"children\":\"← Back to All Guides\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]\",\"children\":\"Buyer's Guide\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"October 11, 2025\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"6 min read\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl uppercase leading-tight text-[var(--ink)] mt-2\",\"children\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Pay: A Buyer's Guide\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--ink)]/20 font-mono text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Written by:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"py-16 bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-3xl space-y-8 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--paper-2)]/90\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 overflow-hidden mb-10 shadow-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L10\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/cover-art/cover-09.jpg\",\"alt\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Pay: A Buyer's Guide\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Most horror stories about commissioned art — ghosted artists, wildly missed deadlines, work that doesn't match the portfolio — are avoidable with a few minutes of vetting before any money changes hands. Here's what's actually worth checking.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Start With the Portfolio, But Look Past the Best Piece\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Every portfolio leads with its strongest work — that's normal. What matters more is consistency:\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Does the quality hold up across the \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"whole\"}],\" portfolio, or is there one standout piece and a big drop-off after it?\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Is there recent work, or does the portfolio look stale (a sign the artist may not be actively taking commissions, or their current skill level has moved past what's shown)?\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Does the range match what you actually need? A portfolio full of fan art doesn't necessarily predict strong original character or cover composition work.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Check for a Real Commission Process, Not Just a DM\"}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\",\"$L1f\",\"$L20\",\"$L21\",\"$L22\",\"$L23\",\"$L24\",\"$L25\",\"$L26\",\"$L27\",\"$L28\",\"$L29\",\"$L2a\"]}],\"$L2b\"]}]}],\"$L2c\",\"$L2d\"]}]\n2e:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n11:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A structured process — a booking form, a published pricing or process page, clear steps from brief to delivery — is one of the strongest trust signals available. It suggests the artist runs this as an actual practice, not an occasional side favor, and it usually means expectations (timeline, revisions, payment) are set upfront rather than negotiated awkwardly mid-project.\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Be more cautious with commissions that only happen through informal DMs with no written process, no clear pricing logic, and no revision policy stated anywhere.\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Ask About Payment Structure\"}]\n14:[\"$\",\"p\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A reasonable, professional structure typically looks like:\"]}]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"A deposit upfront (commonly 30–50%) to confirm the commission and cover initial work\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"li\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"The remainder due at final delivery, or split at a milestone like sketch approval\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"li\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Clear communication about what happens if the project is canceled partway through\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Be cautious of either extreme: 100% payment demanded upfront with no milestones, or an artist unwilling to discuss payment structure at all before starting work.\"]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Look for Evidence of Real Client Communication\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Testimonials, past client shoutouts, or even just responsiveness during your initial inquiry are useful signals. An artist who takes days to respond to a simple pre-commission question is telling you something about communication speed during the actual project.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Confirm Rights and Usage Before You Pay Anything\"}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"This is the most commonly skipped step, and the one that causes real problems later. Before paying a deposit, get clear (ideally in writing) on:\"]}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"li\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Whether you're getting personal-use rights or full commercial/distribution rights\"]}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"li\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Whether the artist retains rights to display the finished piece in their own portfolio\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"li\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"What happens if you want to use the piece somewhere unplanned later (merch, a reissue, a different platform)\"]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Red Flags Worth Taking Seriously\"}]\n21:[\"$\",\"li\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"No visible portfolio, or a portfolio that looks inconsistent with claimed experience level\"]}]\n22:[\"$\",\"li\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Refusal to discuss revisions, timeline, or payment structure before you commit\"]}]\n23:[\"$\",\"li\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Pressure to pay the full amount immediately with no milestone structure\"]}]\n24:[\"$\",\"li\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"No willingness to do a sketch/concept approval stage before full rendering\"]}]\n25:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"What Good Vetting Actually Looks Like in Practice\"}]\n26:[\"$\",\"p\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"None of this requires being adversarial — it's just a short, reasonable set of questions before committing money to a project: What's your process from brief to delivery? What's included in revisions? What are the payment milestones? What rights am I getting? A professional illustrator will typically answer these clearly and without friction — which is itself part of the vetting.\"]}]\n27:[\"$\",\"p\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Structured processes like the one used for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"album, manga, and illustration commissions here\"}],\" are built to make these answers clear upfront, which is exactly what a well-vetted commission should look like from the client's side.\"]}]\n28:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n29:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n2a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Vetting a freelance illustrator takes maybe ten minutes of questions and portfolio review, and it prevents the vast majority of commission problems people run into. A confident, professional artist won't be put off by reasonable questions — if anything, clear answers to them are a good sign you're in the right hands.\"]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT JOB TICKET\"}]]}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"$L2e\",null,{}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-t-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] py-10 color-[var(--paper-2)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-brand font-anton text-[28px] tracking-[0.04em] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":\"JHAY SANYAY\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-sub font-mono text-[12px] text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Visual Artist & Illustrator · Nigeria\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"foot-links flex gap-[20px] font-mono text-[12px] mt-[10px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/portfolio\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Portfolio\"}],[\"$\",\"$Lf\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Guides & Blog\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://linktr.ee/jhaysanyay\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Linktree ↗\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Job Ticket\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[12px] text-[var(--yellow)] mt-[20px] tracking-wider uppercase\",\"children\":[\"designed by \",[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.instagram.com/buildwithclinton/\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--paper)] hover:text-[var(--yellow)] hover:underline transition-colors\",\"children\":\"buildwithclinton ↗\"}]]}]]}]}]\na:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n2f:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n7:null\nc:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Commission (Buyer's Guide) | Jhay Sanyay Studio\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Before you pay for custom cover art, here's how to actually vet a freelance illustrator — portfolio red flags, payment structure, and questions worth asking upfront.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"how to hire a trustworthy illustrator,freelance illustrator red flags,how to vet a freelance artist\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Commission (Buyer's Guide)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"Before you pay for custom cover art, here's how to actually vet a freelance illustrator — portfolio red flags, payment structure, and questions worth asking upfront.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/blog/how-to-vet-a-freelance-illustrator-buyers-guide\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:image\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/images/cover-art/cover-09.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:image:alt\",\"content\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Pay: A Buyer's Guide\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:type\",\"content\":\"article\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"article:published_time\",\"content\":\"2025-10-10T23:00:00.000Z\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"property\":\"article:author\",\"content\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:creator\",\"content\":\"@jhaysanyay\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Commission (Buyer's Guide)\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Before you pay for custom cover art, here's how to actually vet a freelance illustrator — portfolio red flags, payment structure, and questions worth asking upfront.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"19\",{\"name\":\"twitter:image\",\"content\":\"https://jhaysanyay.com/images/cover-art/cover-09.jpg\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"20\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/favicon.ico?favicon.2vob68tjqpejf.ico\",\"sizes\":\"256x256\",\"type\":\"image/x-icon\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"21\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg?icon.1hqt-6fdfs6lm.svg\",\"sizes\":\"any\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\"}],[\"$\",\"$L2f\",\"22\",{}]]\n","/blog/$d$slug/__PAGE__":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[53501,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n3:I[22016,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"\"]\n4:I[85437,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"Image\"]\n25:X\n2a:X\n2a:C\n0:{\"buildId\":\"Ci70N7G2LBQG0cqRgP2oF\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen flex flex-col bg-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L2\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--paper)] py-12 border-b-2 border-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-4xl\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] uppercase font-bold tracking-wider hover:underline inline-block mb-6\",\"children\":\"← Back to All Guides\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-xs text-[var(--muted)] mb-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)] font-bold px-2 py-0.5 uppercase tracking-widest text-[10px]\",\"children\":\"Buyer's Guide\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"October 11, 2025\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"•\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"6 min read\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl uppercase leading-tight text-[var(--ink)] mt-2\",\"children\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Pay: A Buyer's Guide\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 mt-6 pt-4 border-t border-[var(--ink)]/20 font-mono text-xs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[var(--muted)] uppercase\",\"children\":\"Written by:\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"font-bold text-[var(--ink)]\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"py-16 bg-[var(--ink)] text-[var(--paper)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"wrap max-w-3xl space-y-8 font-sans text-lg leading-relaxed text-[var(--paper-2)]/90\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative aspect-[16/9] w-full border-2 border-[var(--paper-2)]/30 overflow-hidden mb-10 shadow-2xl\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L4\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/cover-art/cover-09.jpg\",\"alt\":\"How to Vet a Freelance Illustrator Before You Pay: A Buyer's Guide\",\"fill\":true,\"sizes\":\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 800px\",\"className\":\"object-cover\",\"priority\":true}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Most horror stories about commissioned art — ghosted artists, wildly missed deadlines, work that doesn't match the portfolio — are avoidable with a few minutes of vetting before any money changes hands. Here's what's actually worth checking.\"]}],[\"$\",\"hr\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Start With the Portfolio, But Look Past the Best Piece\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Every portfolio leads with its strongest work — that's normal. What matters more is consistency:\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Does the quality hold up across the \",[\"$\",\"em\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"italic text-[var(--yellow)]\",\"children\":\"whole\"}],\" portfolio, or is there one standout piece and a big drop-off after it?\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Is there recent work, or does the portfolio look stale (a sign the artist may not be actively taking commissions, or their current skill level has moved past what's shown)?\"]}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Does the range match what you actually need? A portfolio full of fan art doesn't necessarily predict strong original character or cover composition work.\"]}],[\"$\",\"h2\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Check for a Real Commission Process, Not Just a DM\"}],\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\",\"$L8\",\"$L9\",\"$La\",\"$Lb\",\"$Lc\",\"$Ld\",\"$Le\",\"$Lf\",\"$L10\",\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\",\"$L14\",\"$L15\",\"$L16\",\"$L17\",\"$L18\",\"$L19\",\"$L1a\",\"$L1b\",\"$L1c\",\"$L1d\",\"$L1e\"]}],\"$L1f\"]}]}],\"$L20\",\"$L21\"]}],[\"$L22\"],\"$L23\"]}],\"isPartial\":\"$@24\",\"staleTime\":\"$25\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L26\",\"isPartial\":\"$@27\",\"staleTime\":\"$25\",\"varyParams\":null},{\"rsc\":\"$L28\",\"isPartial\":\"$@29\",\"staleTime\":\"$25\",\"varyParams\":\"$2a\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L2b\",\"isPartial\":\"$@2c\",\"staleTime\":\"$25\",\"varyParams\":\"$2a\"},{\"rsc\":\"$L2d\",\"isPartial\":\"$@2e\",\"staleTime\":\"$25\",\"varyParams\":null}],\"isUpgradeableISRFallback\":false,\"a\":\"$@2f\",\"rootVaryParams\":null,\"needsRuntimeRequest\":\"$@30\"}\n31:I[87879,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\",\"/_next/static/chunks/3ykrlu0oa3rkw.js\"],\"default\"]\n32:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n33:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\n35:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\n36:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\n37:I[27201,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"IconMark\"]\n38:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n39:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/0h2qsuyze9ds1.js\"],\"default\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2b2j6nos8u62l.css\",\"style\"]\n5:[\"$\",\"p\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A structured process — a booking form, a published pricing or process page, clear steps from brief to delivery — is one of the strongest trust signals available. It suggests the artist runs this as an actual practice, not an occasional side favor, and it usually means expectations (timeline, revisions, payment) are set upfront rather than negotiated awkwardly mid-project.\"]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"p\",\"16\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Be more cautious with commissions that only happen through informal DMs with no written process, no clear pricing logic, and no revision policy stated anywhere.\"]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"18\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Ask About Payment Structure\"}]\n8:[\"$\",\"p\",\"20\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"A reasonable, professional structure typically looks like:\"]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"li\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"A deposit upfront (commonly 30–50%) to confirm the commission and cover initial work\"]}]\na:[\"$\",\"li\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"The remainder due at final delivery, or split at a milestone like sketch approval\"]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"li\",\"24\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Clear communication about what happens if the project is canceled partway through\"]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"p\",\"26\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Be cautious of either extreme: 100% payment demanded upfront with no milestones, or an artist unwilling to discuss payment structure at all before starting work.\"]}]\nd:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"28\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Look for Evidence of Real Client Communication\"}]\ne:[\"$\",\"p\",\"30\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Testimonials, past client shoutouts, or even just responsiveness during your initial inquiry are useful signals. An artist who takes days to respond to a simple pre-commission question is telling you something about communication speed during the actual project.\"]}]\nf:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"32\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Confirm Rights and Usage Before You Pay Anything\"}]\n10:[\"$\",\"p\",\"34\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"This is the most commonly skipped step, and the one that causes real problems later. Before paying a deposit, get clear (ideally in writing) on:\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"li\",\"36\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Whether you're getting personal-use rights or full commercial/distribution rights\"]}]\n12:[\"$\",\"li\",\"37\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Whether the artist retains rights to display the finished piece in their own portfolio\"]}]\n13:[\"$\",\"li\",\"38\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"What happens if you want to use the piece somewhere unplanned later (merch, a reissue, a different platform)\"]}]\n14:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"40\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Red Flags Worth Taking Seriously\"}]\n15:[\"$\",\"li\",\"42\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"No visible portfolio, or a portfolio that looks inconsistent with claimed experience level\"]}]\n16:[\"$\",\"li\",\"43\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Refusal to discuss revisions, timeline, or payment structure before you commit\"]}]\n17:[\"$\",\"li\",\"44\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"Pressure to pay the full amount immediately with no milestone structure\"]}]\n18:[\"$\",\"li\",\"45\",{\"className\":\"ml-6 list-disc mb-2 text-[var(--paper-2)] font-sans\",\"children\":[\"No willingness to do a sketch/concept approval stage before full rendering\"]}]\n19:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"47\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"What Good Vetting Actually Looks Like in Practice\"}]\n1a:[\"$\",\"p\",\"49\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"None of this requires being adversarial — it's just a short, reasonable set of questions before committing money to a project: What's your process from brief to delivery? What's included in revisions? What are the payment milestones? What rights am I getting? A professional illustrator will typically answer these clearly and without friction — which is itself part of the vetting.\"]}]\n1b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"51\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Structured processes like the one used for \",[\"$\",\"a\",\"1\",{\"href\":\"/#order\",\"className\":\"text-[var(--yellow)] font-bold underline hover:text-[var(--red)] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"album, manga, and illustration commissions here\"}],\" are built to make these answers clear upfront, which is exactly what a well-vetted commission should look like from the client's side.\"]}]\n1c:[\"$\",\"hr\",\"53\",{\"className\":\"my-8 border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/30\"}]\n1d:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"55\",{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase text-[var(--paper)] mt-12 mb-4 pt-6 border-t border-dashed border-[var(--paper-2)]/20\",\"children\":\"Final Thoughts\"}]\n1e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"57\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 font-sans leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"Vetting a freelance illustrator takes maybe ten minutes of questions and portfolio review, and it prevents the vast majority of commission problems people run into. A confident, professional artist won't be put off by reasonable questions — if anything, clear answers to them are a good sign you're in the right hands.\"]}]\n1f:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 p-8 bg-[var(--paper)] text-[var(--ink)] border-2 border-[var(--ink)] shadow-[10px_10px_0_var(--red)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"font-mono text-xs text-[var(--red)] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest mb-1\",\"children\":\"Ready to Commission?\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"font-anton text-3xl uppercase mb-3\",\"children\":\"Get Your Custom Artwork Stamped\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-sans text-[var(--muted)] mb-6\",\"children\":\"Jhay Sanyay Studio handles custom cover art, manga/comic illustrations, and logo design from brief submission to final delivery. Fill out your job ticket below for a 48-hour quote.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#order\",\"className\":\"stamp-btn inline-block !py-3 !px-6\",\"children\":\"FILL OUT JOB TICKET\"}]]}]\n20:[\"$\",\"$L31\",null,{}]\n21:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[var(--ink)] border-t-2 border-[var(--paper-2)] py-10 color-[var(--paper-2)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"